---
// Architecture component - School LAN topology for Talisay Integrated School
---

<section id="architecture" class="relative bg-[#09110c] py-24 border-t border-[#1f3627] text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#2a4c37] bg-[#112017] px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80]">
        <img src="/tis_logo.png" alt="TIS Logo" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 object-contain" />
        <span>Campus Network Topology</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Designed for Talisay Integrated School LAN & offline resilience.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
        TIS RMS runs directly on a local school server in Tiaong, Quezon — teachers never have to pause work when local internet is slow or interrupted.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Tier Architecture Diagram Visual -->
    <div class="mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#0c1610] p-6 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-2xl">
      
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#1f3627] pb-5">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white">Full-Stack Campus Topology</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Talisay Integrated School Local Network Architecture</p>
        </div>
        <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#16a34a]/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-[#4ade80] font-semibold border border-[#16a34a]/30">
          Campus LAN Mode (Offline-First)
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        
        <!-- Tier 1: Clients -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017]/90 p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded bg-blue-500/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/25">
                Teacher Terminals
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Flutter SDK</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Teacher & Staff Clients</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Fast native interface for faculty desks and mobile document scanning.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Windows Desktop App</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Faculty Workstations & Registrars</div>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Android Mobile App</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">MLKit Camera Document Scanner</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono border-t border-[#1f3627] pt-3">
            Local HTTP / REST Campus API
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2: Backend Server & DB -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#16a34a]/40 bg-[#09110c] p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded bg-[#16a34a]/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#4ade80] border border-[#16a34a]/40">
                School Server Core
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4ade80] font-mono">Express 5.2</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Node.js Express & SQLite</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Local server REST API with SQLite (`tis_rms.db`) persistence.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">better-sqlite3 DB</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Zero-maintenance local file database</div>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Windows Service Daemon</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Runs continuously on designated school PC</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-[#4ade80] font-mono border-t border-[#1f3627] pt-3">
            Offline Campus LAN Hub
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3: OCR & Report Generators -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#23412f] bg-[#112017]/90 p-6">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="rounded bg-amber-500/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">
                Processing Engines
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">DepEd Suite</span>
            </div>

            <h4 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">OCR & Document Engine</h4>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">Ghostscript PDF rasterizer, Tesseract OCR & ExcelJS.</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2.5">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Tesseract OCR Engine</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Text & basic field extraction (2021+)</div>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#254231] bg-[#09110c] p-3">
                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">ExcelJS SF-10 Processor</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">DepEd JHS & SHS template integration</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono border-t border-[#1f3627] pt-3">
            Local Binaries & Offline Engines
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Why School LAN Architecture? Grid -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[#4ade80]">01</div>
        <h4 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Zero Internet Dependency</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Faculty and advisers at Talisay Integrated School can register basic student information, upload documents, and generate reports seamlessly over local Wi-Fi / Ethernet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">02</div>
        <h4 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Student Data Privacy</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Learner basic records and historical documents remain safely within Talisay school hardware with no public cloud security risks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#233e2e] bg-[#112017]/80 p-6 transition hover:border-[#16a34a] hover:bg-[#15271d]">
        <div class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-[#4ade80]">03</div>
        <h4 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white">Fast Local Performance</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Local SQLite operations (`better-sqlite3`) ensure instantaneous PDF previews, student directory lookups, and report generation across campus workstations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
